We first assume a population of 100 to facilitate solving. Then we simply organize the statistics given into a Venn diagram. \[  egin{aligned} &100 \ &	ext{\[  egin{tikzpicture} \draw (0,0) circle (1.5cm) node[above right] {A}; \draw (2,0) circle (1.5cm) node[above right] {B}; \draw (1,1.732) circle (1.5cm) node[above right] {C}; 
ode at (0.5,0.866) {14}; 
